    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d547">

                <pb facs="0671" n="563" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg563"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Snowden.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-01-20"><hi rendition="#italic">January 20,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President has inquired the progress being made in Caroline settlement. It
                    should be pressed to early conclusion.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foster</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
